    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"a decision\"... you make it sound so calm. like it's just something i can choose to do to make the pain stop. but i feel like i'm already a ghost. like i'm already gone and everyone's just waiting for me to realize it. if the world has already decided that i'm nothing, then what's the point in even trying to exist anymore? it's like i'm just waiting for the end anyway. isn't it better to just... finish it? to make it official?",
